          "text": "Meal-related fatigue"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For 3–4 months, meals take 'ages'; patient feels 'worn out' by the end of a meal and reports being more tired in the afternoons, worse after meals. Still working usual hours but slows down a bit after lunch."
      }
    },
