          "text": "Swallowing difficulty with solids"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports food is sometimes slow going down and occasionally 'catches' mid-chest, especially meat and dry bread. Needs to sip water with solids and avoids harder foods at work, preferring softer food."
